00:14:20.121 --> 00:14:23.418
- In fact, I have learned the maximum

00:14:23.418 --> 00:14:24.835
from my failures.

00:14:25.736 --> 00:14:27.941
My failures have taught me the most.

00:14:27.941 --> 00:14:30.812
And so I really value my failures.

00:14:30.812 --> 00:14:32.493
Whatever I am today is because,

00:14:32.493 --> 00:14:33.623
not only because of my successes,

00:14:33.623 --> 00:14:35.255
but also because of my failures.

00:14:35.255 --> 00:14:36.968
Whatever I've learned, you know,

00:14:36.968 --> 00:14:38.051
through my failures.

00:14:38.051 --> 00:14:40.213
And so, I have always done

00:14:40.213 --> 00:14:41.376
what I believed in.

00:14:41.376 --> 00:14:43.667
And I continue to do that.

00:14:43.667 --> 00:14:45.334
I strongly feel that

00:14:46.326 --> 00:14:50.046
creative exchange, creative people,

00:14:50.046 --> 00:14:51.629
have no boundaries.

00:14:52.956 --> 00:14:55.562
Jackie Chan is so popular
all over the world.

00:14:55.562 --> 00:14:59.173
It doesn't matter that he's
belonging to one country.

00:14:59.173 --> 00:15:01.204
Over time, he belongs to the whole world.

00:15:01.204 --> 00:15:03.196
And he entertains everyone.

00:15:03.196 --> 00:15:04.772
So, I think that for creative people

00:15:04.772 --> 00:15:05.826
there are no boundaries.

00:15:05.826 --> 00:15:09.155
And it is the creative
people who try and bring

00:15:09.155 --> 00:15:12.072
cultures together, people together.

